{c: Verse 1}
[F]Sathiya Tune Kya Kiya
[F]Beliya Ye Tune Kya Kiya
[C]Maine Kiya Tera Intezar
[F]Itna [C]Karo Naa [F]Muje Pyar
[F]Sathiya Tune Kya Kaha
[F]Beliya Ye Tune Kya Kaha
[C]Yu Na Kabhi Karna Intezar
[F]Maine [C]Kiya Hain [F]Tumase Pyar
[F]Itanee Mohababt Sah Na Sakunga,
[D#]Sach Main [A#]Zinda Rah [F]Na Sakunga
[F]Tujhko Samloo Yeh Mera Jimma,
[D#]Mai Hu [A#]Toh Kya [F]Hain Jane Tamana
[F]Abb Jeena Marana Mera
[C]Janam Tere [F]Hath Hain
[F]Maine Kaha Na Sanam,
[C]Abb Tu [F]Mere Sath Hai
[F]Toh Phir Sambhal, Lalallaala
[Dm]Ke Mein Chala lllaaalala
[F]Jana Kaha, lalalallala
[Dm]Aa [F]Dil [C]Me [F]Aa lalalallal
[F]Dil Ke Chaman Ka Hasna To Dekha
[D#]Jagee Nazar [A#]Ka Sapana [F]To Dekha
[F]Ese Bane Ham Ek Jan Ek Dil
[D#]Tu Hai [A#]Ke Mai Hu [F]Kahna Ho Mushkil
[F]Chota Basanti Hain Tu,
[C]Tan Hain [F]Gulabi Meraa
[F]Do Rang Mile Ke Bad
[C]Hote Nahee [F]Hain Juda
[F]Toh Phir Samhal, lalala
[Dm]Le Mein Chala lalalalaala
[F]Jana Kaha, Lalaallala
[Dm]Aa [F]Dil Mein [C]Aa La [F]Lla La
